msgid ""
"- `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-w8a8-mtp` (Quantized version): requires 1 Atlas 800 A3 (128GB × 8) node or 1 Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × 8) node. [Download model weight](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-w8a8-mtp)\n"
"- For Ascend 950DT servers, use the original [`DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731`](https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731) weights released by DeepSeek on Hugging Face. The Attention weights use MXFP8, while the MoE weights use MXFP4 with 4-bit weights and 8-bit activation computation (W4A8). No Ascend-specific quantization or weight conversion is required. Both the mixed-deployment example in Section 5.1 and the 1P1D example in Section 5.2.3 use two Ascend 950DT servers (96GB × 8). The mixed deployment uses four NPUs, while the 1P1D deployment assigns one server to Prefill and one server to Decode."
msgstr ""
"- `DeepSeek-V4-Flash-w8a8-mtp`（量化版本）：需要 1 个 Atlas 800 A3（128GB × 8）节点或 1 个 Atlas 800 A2（64GB × 8）节点。[下载模型权重](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-w8a8-mtp)\n"
"- 对于 Ascend 950DT 服务器，请使用 DeepSeek 在 Hugging Face 上发布的原始 [`DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731`](https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731) 权重。Attention 权重使用 MXFP8，而 MoE 权重使用 MXFP4，即 4-bit 权重和 8-bit 激活计算（W4A8）。无需进行昇腾特定的量化或权重转换。第 5.1 节的混合部署示例和第 5.2.3 节的 1P1D 示例均使用两台 Ascend 950DT 服务器（96GB × 8）。混合部署使用四个 NPU，而 1P1D 部署将一台服务器分配给 Prefill，另一台分配给 Decode。"

