msgstr "| 验证 | 仅 P→D KV 传输 | 在重复前缀预热后，还需检查 Prefill 池的查找/获取/写入命中情况 |"

msgid "#### 5.3.1 Prerequisites"
msgstr "#### 5.3.1 前提条件"

msgid ""
"Mount the host HCCN config into every container that participates in "
"pooling:"
msgstr "将宿主机的 HCCN 配置挂载到每个参与池化的容器中："

msgid ""
"On 950DT products, also keep the `/etc/hixlep/` mount from Section 5.2 for "
"Ascend direct KV transfer."
msgstr "在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，还需保留第 5.2 节中的 `/etc/hixlep/` 挂载，用于昇腾直接 KV 传输。"

msgid ""
"Install MemFabric and Memcache (MemCache depends on MemFabric, so install "
"MemFabric first):"
msgstr "安装 MemFabric 和 Memcache（MemCache 依赖于 MemFabric，因此请先安装 MemFabric）："

msgid ""
"Configure the memcache config files. Run `pip show memcache_hybrid` and find"
" the `Location` value in the output. Use that value as `{INSTALL_PATH}` "
"below. The configuration files are located at "
"`{INSTALL_PATH}/memcache_hybrid/config`."
msgstr ""
"配置 memcache 配置文件。运行 `pip show memcache_hybrid` 并在输出中找到 `Location` 值。将该值作为下方的"
" `{INSTALL_PATH}`。配置文件位于 `{INSTALL_PATH}/memcache_hybrid/config`。"

msgid "`mmc-meta.conf` (used by the MetaService on one node):"
msgstr "`mmc-meta.conf`（由单个节点上的 MetaService 使用）："

msgid "`mmc-local.conf` (used by every Prefill / Decode rank):"
msgstr "`mmc-local.conf`（由每个 Prefill / Decode rank 使用）："

msgid ""
"> The `ock.mmc.meta_service_url` on the P node and D node must point to the "
"same MetaService endpoint, and `ock.mmc.local_service.config_store_url` must"
" match `ock.mmc.meta_service.config_store_url` in `mmc-meta.conf`. For the "
"recommended `ock.mmc.local_service.protocol` on each hardware series and "
"SSD-related parameters, see [Configuring the memcache Config "
"File](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md#step-33-configuring-the-"
"memcache-config-file)."
msgstr ""
"> P 节点和 D 节点上的 `ock.mmc.meta_service_url` 必须指向同一个 MetaService 端点，并且 "
"`ock.mmc.local_service.config_store_url` 必须与 `mmc-meta.conf` 中的 "
"`ock.mmc.meta_service.config_store_url` 一致。关于各硬件系列推荐的 "
"`ock.mmc.local_service.protocol` 以及 SSD 相关参数，请参见[配置 memcache "
"配置文件](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md#step-33-configuring-the-"
"memcache-config-file)。"

msgid "#### 5.3.2 Prefill / Decode Scripts"
msgstr "#### 5.3.2 Prefill / Decode 脚本"

msgid ""
"Reuse Section 5.2 `launch_online_dp.py`. Replace each role's startup command"
" with the pooled version below. Keep the Section 5.2 `vllm serve` flag "
"style; only `--kv-transfer-config` switches to `MultiConnector`."
msgstr ""
"复用第 5.2 节的 `launch_online_dp.py`。将每个角色的启动命令替换为下方使用连接池的版本。保持第 5.2 节 `vllm "
"serve` 的参数风格；仅将 `--kv-transfer-config` 切换为 `MultiConnector`。"

msgid "**Prefill node:**"
msgstr "**Prefill 节点：**"

msgid "**Decode node:**"
msgstr "**Decode 节点：**"

msgid "#### 5.3.3 Start the Services"
msgstr "#### 5.3.3 启动服务"

msgid "Start in this order:"
msgstr "按以下顺序启动："

msgid ""
"Start the Memcache MetaService on one node and confirm the ports are "
"reachable:"
msgstr "在一个节点上启动 Memcache MetaService，并确认端口可达："

msgid ""
"Start Decode with the Section 5.2 `launch_online_dp.py` command for your "
"platform. Wait until every Decode rank prints `Application startup "
"complete`."
msgstr ""
"使用适用于你平台的第 5.2 节 `launch_online_dp.py` 命令启动 Decode。等待每个 Decode rank 打印 "
"`Application startup complete`。"

msgid ""
"Start Prefill the same way. Wait until every Prefill rank prints "
"`Application startup complete`."
msgstr "以相同方式启动 Prefill。等待每个 Prefill rank 打印 `Application startup complete`。"

msgid ""
"Start the Section 5.2 proxy. The service is then accessible at "
"`<proxy_ip>:8009`. Use this proxy endpoint in Chapter 6."
msgstr "启动第 5.2 节的代理。随后可通过 `<proxy_ip>:8009` 访问该服务。在第 6 章中使用此代理端点。"

msgid "#### 5.3.4 Verification"
msgstr "#### 5.3.4 验证"

msgid ""
"1. Confirm the Memcache MetaService ports are reachable.\n"
"2. Confirm every Decode engine port is ready, then every Prefill engine port.\n"
"3. Send requests only to the proxy on port 8009.\n"
"4. Warm up with a repeated-prefix request, then send again and check Prefill logs for KV Pool lookup/get/put and hit information.\n"
"5. Confirm Decode logs still show a normal P→D KV transfer."
msgstr ""
"1. 确认 Memcache MetaService 端口可达。\n"
"2. 确认每个 Decode 引擎端口已就绪，然后确认每个 Prefill 引擎端口。\n"
"3. 仅向端口 8009 上的代理发送请求。\n"
"4. 使用重复前缀请求进行预热，然后再次发送，并检查 Prefill 日志中的 KV Pool lookup/get/put 及命中信息。\n"
"5. 确认 Decode 日志仍显示正常的 P→D KV 传输。"

msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If you encounter issues with PD separation deployment "
"with Memcache KV Cache Pool, refer to the [Memcache "
"FAQ](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md#54-memcache-faq) and the "
"[Public FAQs](../../faqs.md) for troubleshooting."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果在使用 Memcache KV Cache Pool 进行 PD 分离部署时遇到问题，请参阅 [Memcache "
"FAQ](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md#54-memcache-faq) 和[公共 "
"FAQ](../../faqs.md) 进行故障排查。"

